{"version":1,"key":"card:707","content":{"id":707,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在经济运行中，供给和需求往往难以天然匹配，市场上总会出现商品积压卖不出去，或者需求旺盛却供不应求的情况。出清（Market Clearing）描述的正是市场消化这种失衡、最终重新达到均衡的过程。当某一价格水平下，买方愿意购买的数量恰好等于卖方愿意出售的数量，市场便实现了出清。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4d15d270-cd12-400b-a956-20891806648c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"出清在不同场景中有不同的表现形式：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0a04ea82-8d90-4b55-8c99-1c3ac3cbab26","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"产业出清：过度投资或经济下行会导致产能过剩，大量商品积压、企业持续亏损，部分企业沦为依赖补贴勉强维持的僵尸企业。市场通过降价、兼并乃至企业倒闭，逐步淘汰效率低下的落后产能，推动资源向优质企业重新配置，这便是产业出清。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9e58ffa0-0c96-43fa-8061-8c36f8278a80","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7ee1068c-28c0-4333-9371-a5d562b83547","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"股市/债市出清：市场出现恐慌性抛售，价格暴跌。当价格跌到足够低时，吸引买家入场，价格不再下跌，恐慌情绪得到释放，市场完成出清。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"94896474-9f4d-4cb6-a657-62e6d916e57e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"589d645d-34ff-4b00-8cfc-a094fdc3e598","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"7e531095-2025-4b7f-a647-ce4f6c395691","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"出清本质上是一个\"清零并达到平衡\"的动态过程，通过价格机制自动调节市场的供需失衡。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b89aaa8d-b687-4040-a383-a27554cb50d4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["经济/出清","概念"],"createTime":1778805035100,"updateTime":1793532633336,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532633336}}